(6195000, 914911, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice amount of details, nice composition, and pleasing lighting. The one thing that strikes me with this photo that could be improved is actually the chalk selection colors. Maybe get some green or purple in there to make it even more fun (shades of peach/tan just don''t say fun to me).</td>', 'Nice amount of details, nice composition, and pleasing lighting. The one thing that strikes me with this photo that could be improved is actually the chalk selection colors. Maybe get some green or purple in there to make it even more fun (shades of peach/tan just don''t say fun to me).', '2010-10-18 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
