(6195275, 914910, 81362, '<td valign="top">Very creative design and sharp enought to work. Unfortunately, there seems to be a yellow color cast (especially seen in lens lettering that normally would look white). If captured under tungsten light, setting camera white balance or adjusting in post processing might be worth considering.</td>', 'Very creative design and sharp enought to work. Unfortunately, there seems to be a yellow color cast (especially seen in lens lettering that normally would look white). If captured under tungsten light, setting camera white balance or adjusting in post processing might be worth considering.', '2010-10-19 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
