(6200718, 914537, 103142, '<td valign="top">So close to a 7!! But what way to get a pb! Personally, in my mind, an HM is a ribbon, because you get the little icon on the left hand side where the ribbons go. So you''ve got a ribbon, just not a front page one. :)<br/> <br/>I thought this was spectacular -- and my pick of the challenge.</td>', 'So close to a 7!! But what way to get a pb! Personally, in my mind, an HM is a ribbon, because you get the little icon on the left hand side where the ribbons go. So you''ve got a ribbon, just not a front page one. :) I thought this was spectacular -- and my pick of the challenge.', '2010-10-25 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 0),
