(6200931, 914914, 62357, '<td valign="top">Oh I''m coming back to this because I just saw Penny''s comment.  I have to confess to my ignorance, I did not know who Baldessari was, but I googled him and laughed even harder.  Well done.  You and Paul <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ubique</a> both taught me something new today.  Excellent.</td>', 'Oh I''m coming back to this because I just saw Penny''s comment.  I have to confess to my ignorance, I did not know who Baldessari was, but I googled him and laughed even harder.  Well done.  You and Paul  Ubique both taught me something new today.  Excellent.', '2010-10-25 15:10:13.000000', NULL, 0),
