(6217281, 914918, 59267, '<td valign="top">More and more rules and limits will just discourage creativity and limit inspiration. The consequence is the overall number of visitors to dpc will be decreased, because the creative and interesting photos like this will be submitted to other community sites but dpc. Is that a good thing for dpc? 1X.com is selling prints and maybe, in the near future, betterphoto.com. How can dpcprints keep running?</td>', 'More and more rules and limits will just discourage creativity and limit inspiration. The consequence is the overall number of visitors to dpc will be decreased, because the creative and interesting photos like this will be submitted to other community sites but dpc. Is that a good thing for dpc? 1X.com is selling prints and maybe, in the near future, betterphoto.com. How can dpcprints keep running?', '2010-11-09 00:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
